PROJECT HANDOFF: REXBURG CUTS AI RECEPTIONIST
1. Project Overview

I'm building an AI-powered voice receptionist for a fictional barbershop called Rexburg Cuts.

The goal is to create a natural, real-time conversational receptionist that customers can speak to through a web browser.

The receptionist should:

Greet customers naturally.
Answer questions about services and pricing.
Explain business hours.
Handle appointment inquiries conversationally.
Eventually integrate with an actual booking calendar.
Speak naturally with a high-quality human-like voice.
Understand spoken English accurately.
Support interruptions and natural conversation.

This is a university computing project running on a remote Linux machine.

